  "description": "\"Aren't you too old to be meeting 'uncle' now?\"\n\nSix years. That's how long Min Yoo-hee has been partners with Park Moo-jin.\n\nNow twenty-six, Yoo-hee is informed by Moo-jin that he wants to end their relationship.\n\n\"It was fun, Min Yoo-hee.\"\n\n\"I don't understand the reason. I want to continue with you, can't I?\"\n\nHandsome men lacked desperation,\n\nand I didn't have the stomach to kiss an ugly face.\n\nAmidst that, the man I found was Park Moo-jin.\n\nBut then.\n\n\"You were prettiest when you were twenty.\"\n\n\"...I'm still pretty now.\"\n\n\"Look at this. You're so well-handled, it's cute how quickly you respond to my touch, but\n\n...\"\n\n\"I enjoy teaching women who haven't been touched by men, my own way. It's getting a bit boring.\"\n\n'...This dildo-bastard is rude.'\n\nThat day, I decided.\n\nI would make him thrust his hips like a beast, overcome by pleasure, in front of the woman he was utterly sick of and had thrown away.\n\n\"Look forward to it, 'uncle'.\"\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10624297)",
